28","i":39936.86,"e":"240829_ICI_OB_TF","a":"C","u":"wGtZu6DuOCKOUi78BmzhOQ%3D%3D","c":null},{"f":"2025-02-26","i":39307.63,"e":"0000040203","a":"A","u":"8vzs0IyEInUzjChw4z%2FXvw%3D%3D","c":"45"}],"q":null,"nivel":"insuficiente"}},"hash":"68dab35d4a2521df","ia":{"es":"Qué muestran los datos: Entre 2023 y 2025, este organismo adjudicó 34 contratos menores de servicios y suministros de más de 14.000 y hasta 15.000 euros, justo por debajo del límite legal. Si esos importes se repartieran como en la franja inmediatamente inferior, lo esperable serían 7,8 contratos. La razón entre observados y esperados es 4,4, con un intervalo de confianza del 95 % de 2,7 a 7,1. En diciembre se adjudicó el 12 % de los contratos junto al límite, mientras que diciembre supone el 9 % de todos sus contratos de servicios y suministros. Los contratos junto al límite se reparten entre 23 adjudicatarios distintos. El contrato [1], de 14.910 euros, se adjudicó en diciembre de 2025.\nQué no pueden demostrar: La concentración de contratos al límite no implica irregularidades. Puede deberse a razones legítimas como presupuestos cerrados o necesidades específicas. No refleja actos maliciosos ni falta de transparencia.\nQué se puede revisar: Comprobar si los contratos [1] y [2] atienden necesidades similares. Verificar si el adjudicatario A repite contratos en años distintos. Analizar si los contratos al límite se distribuyen uniformemente entre los adjudicatarios.","en":"What the data shows: Between 2023 and 2025, this body awarded 34 minor contracts for services and supplies above 14,000 and up to 15,000 euros, just under the legal limit. If those amounts were spread as in the band immediately below, 7.8 contracts would be expected. The observed-to-expected ratio is 4.4, with a 95% confidence interval of 2.7 to 7.1. December accounts for 12% of the contracts just under the limit, compared with 9% of all its services and supplies contracts. The awardee with the most contracts just under the limit, called awardee A here, has 4. Contract [1], for 14,910 euros, was awarded in December 2025.\nWhat it cannot show: The concentration of contracts in December and the high number of awardees do not indicate improper conduct. These patterns could reflect normal market conditions or budget constraints, not wrongdoing.\nWhat can be checked: Check the dates and amounts of contracts awarded in December to see if they align with other contracts in the same period. Review awardee A's contracts to determine if they cover similar services or if multiple contracts were used for the same need.","origen_es":"modelo","origen_en":"modelo","modelo":"Qwen3-4B (Q4_K_M, llama.cpp)","regla":"ss","citas":["h%2BaXy98OFW2P%2Bo96UAV7cQ%3D%3D","l5DDXz%2Bb3w07u6%2B%2FR7DUoA%3D%3D","FRKUIzcaIZM7%2B9FIQYNjeQ%3D%3D"],"generado":"2026-11-15"}}